---
---

<section class="relative min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden pt-20">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 z-0">
        <div class="grid grid-cols-10 grid-rows-10 h-full w-full">
            { Array(100).fill(0).map((_, i) => (
                    <div class="border border-white/5"></div>
            )) }
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="container mx-auto px-4 z-10 text-center">
        <h1 class="text-6xl md:text-8xl lg:text-9xl font-black mb-6 tracking-tighter glitch">
            HACK<span class="text-[#0066ff]">//</span>UTEC
        </h1>

        <p class="text-xl md:text-2xl mb-8 max-w-2xl mx-auto text-white/80">
            Atrévete a cambiar las reglas. Imagina el futuro. En solo 24 horas, todo puede pasar.
        </p>

        <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-4 justify-center">
            <a href="#register" class="px-8 py-4 bg-[#0066ff] text-white font-bold text-lg hover:bg-[#0052cc] transition-colors">
                Regístrate Ahora
            </a>
            <a href="#about" class="px-8 py-4 border border-white text-white font-bold text-lg hover:bg-white hover:text-black transition-colors">
                Descubre Más
            </a>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-16 flex items-center justify-center gap-4">
            <div class="text-center">
                <p class="text-white/60">Fecha</p>
                <p class="text-xl font-bold">21 & 22 de Junio</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="absolute bottom-10 left-1/2 transform -translate-x-1/2 animate-bounce">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="text-white/60">
            <path d="M12 5v14"></path>
            <path d="m19 12-7 7-7-7"></path>
        </svg>
    </div>
</section>
